[00:16.63] They live a lifestyle that is comfortable
[00:19.91] They travel far to keep their stomachs full
[00:23.31] They make a living off of arts and crafts
[00:26.64] The kind with seashells, driftwood and burlap
[00:29.96] They make a deal when they would come to town
